@startuml use-case-choreography
!include style.iuml
title ChorNMT - choreography use cases
left to right direction
' Every actor is a column of the "Who can do what" table of docs/choreography-policies.md, played
' by the experiment accounts listed; every use case names its trust-table row, the experiment
' evidence (transactions or reads of evaluation/evidence/), and the test:policies cases that prove
' it. npm run check:use-cases checks all of them both ways. The Master and Creator policies are
' never replaced (open question in docs/decisions.md), so those use cases are not shown.
' accounts: Administrator
actor "Authorized creator\n(account 0)" as Creator
' accounts: Administrator, Partner
actor "Holder\n(account 0, then 1)" as Holder
' accounts: eth_call
actor "Anyone else" as Anyone
rectangle "ChoreographyNMT + ChoreographyMutableAsset" {
  ' trust: choreography:mint
  ' evidence: F2.mint, F2.denied.unauthorized-creator, F2.denied.ineligible-holder, F7.mint, F8.new-instance.mint
  ' test: authorized creator mints eligible holder; unauthorized creator cannot mint; authorized creator cannot assign an ineligible holder
  usecase "Mint an instance of the\nchoreography type" as UC_Mint
  ' trust: choreography:transferFrom
  ' evidence: F7.transfer, F7.denied.transfer
  ' test: holder transfers to eligible holder; holder cannot transfer to an ineligible holder
  usecase "Transfer the instance\nto an eligible holder" as UC_Transfer
  ' trust: choreography:setNodes
  ' evidence: F5.delta, F5.denied.task-limit, F5.denied.flow-limit, F5.denied.task-name, F5.denied.unknown-target, F5.denied.protected-node, F7.denied.delta
  ' test: creator and holder update nodes; creator policy denies task count above limit; non-holder cannot update choreography
  usecase "Apply a BPMN delta\n(setNodes)" as UC_Nodes
  ' trust: choreography:setRoles
  ' evidence: F2.roles, F8.new-instance.roles
  ' test: creator and holder update roles; non-holder cannot update choreography
  usecase "Assign role accounts\n(setRoles)" as UC_Roles
  ' trust: choreography:setRoles
  ' evidence: F3.link, F3.denied.plain-account, F3.denied.carrier-license, F3.denied.supplier-license, F3.denied.new-role, F8.new-instance.link
  ' test: holder links a role to a certified license; creator policy denies a plain account for a licensed role
  usecase "Link a role to a\nparticipant license" as UC_Link
  ' trust: choreography:setNodes, choreography:setRoles
  ' evidence: F5.delta, F5.denied.task-limit, F3.denied.carrier-license
  ' test: creator policy denies task count above limit; creator policy denies a license of another type
  usecase "Check domain constraints\n(Creator AND Holder)" as UC_Domain
  ' trust: choreography:setHolderSmartPolicy
  ' evidence: F7.holder.deny-all
  ' test: holder installs restrictive policy; holder policy can deny further updates
  usecase "Install a Holder policy\n(e.g. DenyAllSmartPolicy)" as UC_Holder
  ' trust: choreography:setLinked
  ' evidence: test-only
  ' test: holder links the asset; non-holder cannot link the asset
  usecase "Link the asset\n(setLinked)" as UC_Linked <<test only>>
  ' trust: choreography:tokenURI
  ' evidence: F4.tokenURI, F8.tokenURI
  usecase "Read the model\n(tokenURI)" as UC_Read
  ' trust: choreography:tokenURI
  ' evidence: F4.tokenURI, F8.tokenURI
  usecase "Render the BPMN\n(off-chain)" as UC_Render
}
Creator --> UC_Mint
Holder --> UC_Nodes
Holder --> UC_Roles
Holder --> UC_Holder
Holder --> UC_Transfer
Holder --> UC_Linked
UC_Link .> UC_Roles : <<extend>>
UC_Nodes ..> UC_Domain : <<include>>
UC_Roles ..> UC_Domain : <<include>>
Anyone --> UC_Read
Anyone --> UC_Render
UC_Render ..> UC_Read : <<include>>
note bottom of UC_Domain
  evaluateNodeUpdate / evaluateRoleUpdate
  of IChoreographyPolicy, asked of both
  the Creator and the Holder policy.
end note
note bottom of UC_Linked
  <<test only>>: proved by test:policies,
  not exercised by the experiment.
end note
@enduml
